iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-13T16:22:54Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T20:15:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.7.dev4.official, v4.5.0\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen updating Size Limit in the Import tab for more than one PNG, Godot will not update them unless the user sets it first to a different value.\n\nWorkaround:\n- Before pressing Reimport, change Size Limit to other value and then to the preferred one.\n\nFix:\n- Godot should detect that the size limits of the selected files are different and apply them when pressing Import.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add 2 PNG files to a project: one imported with Size Limit 64 and the other with 128.\n- In FileSystem, select both files. Go to Import tab.\n- Size Limit will be checked and will show the lowest common size of both images (64 in this case). Because it is checked, the changes should be applied when pressing Reimport.\n- It doesn't update the Size Limit for the PNG with Size Limit 128.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118525/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}